# Ticket text and downloaded attachments. Never commit these: they are the
# contents of your tracker, on a public repository.
artifacts/

# Local configuration and state. `credentials` holds an API token: it is listed
# here as defence in depth, since the real file lives in ~/.config/lazyfish/ and
# nothing ever writes it into a repository.
config.toml
credentials
*.db
*.db-journal

# Design notes and planning documents. These are working material, not part of
# the distributed tool, and they discuss context that does not belong in a
# public repository.
.design/

